 is not pleased with his sister, as she had previously kidnapped Mitsuru and stripped him to his underwear.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/120021/1203761.jpg"},{"title":"Here is Devilwood","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1055","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1804","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1804","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"43340","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120021","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"87267","synopsis":"It's time for the annual school festival and Shinobu informs everyone that Greenwood will be making a movie. Written and directed by Tochizawa, with computer effects by Aoki, and starring Mitsuru, hinobu and Kazuya, this project could bring in enough money to throw an enormous party!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/120021/1203771.jpg"},{"title":"The Phantom of Greenwood","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1055","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1804","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1804","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"43340","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120021","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"87268","synopsis":"Misako, a sixteen year old ghost-girl, decides to haunt Mitsuru. It's common knowlege that only unresolved loves and regrets cause hauntings,\r\nbut Mitsuru vehemently denies even knowing the girl. Be that as it may, Misako is determined to stay until Mitsuru agrees to kiss her. To make matters worse, Misako will have to possess Shinobu's body in order to\r\nperform the deed, as her own form is insubstantial. . .","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/120021/1203781.jpg"},{"title":"Suka-chan`s Second Love: I`m So Glad That I Fell in Love with You","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1055","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1804","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1804","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"43340","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120021","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"87269","synopsis":"Mitsuru's former kouhai, Igarashi Miya, shows up at the dorm, on the run from a bunch of girl gang members. Though she presents a tough exterior,\r\nMiya is in trouble, and she knows it. When Igarashi gets called out, Kazuya and the others have to work fast to help her. Mitsuru also catches a nasty cold, and Shinobu's psychotic sister makes another appearance.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/120021/1203791.jpg"},{"title":"Suka-chan`s Second Love, Part II","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1055","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1804","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1804","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"43340","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120021","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"87270","synopsis":"Kazuya can't get Igarashi Miya out of his mind. Is it love? What are his chances with \"the punk girl\" when she's had a steady boyfriend for the past ten years?! Needing a break, Kazuya visits Mitsuru's home and finds out why his sempai chose to live in the dorms. With encouragement from everyone (including his sister-in-law!), Kazuya decides to confess his\r\nfeelings for Igarashi. But first, he has to find her!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/120021/1203801.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":1804,"malId":1804},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-28T07:48:11Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:1804","mal:1804"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-v2","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1055","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-6":"1-6"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1804","ranges":{"1-6":"1-6"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"1804","ranges":{"1-6":"1-6"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"43340","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-6":"1-6"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120021","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-6":"1-6"}}]},"sourceMetadata":{"info":{"id":5851,"title":"Koko wa Green Wood","title_eng":"Here is Greenwood","slug":"here-is-greenwood","plot":"Hasukawa Kazuya decide di vivere nel collegio della sua scuola superiore, lì incontra molti tipi originali. Il protagonista si è allontanato da casa perchè suo fratello ha sposato la ragazza di cui Kazuya è sempre stato innamorato.","type":"OVA","status":"Terminato","date":"1991","studio":"Studio Pierrot","dub":0,"mal_id":1804,"anilist_id":1804,"imageurl":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/1804.jpg","imageurl_cover":null,"cover":null,"score":"7.33","episodes_count":6,"genres":["Comedy","Drama","Romance","Shoujo","Slice of Life","Supernatural"],"related":[]},"embedded":{"id":5851,"user_id":2,"title":"Koko wa Green Wood","imageurl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/1804.jpg","plot":"Hasukawa Kazuya decide di vivere nel collegio della sua scuola superiore, lì incontra molti tipi originali. Il protagonista si è allontanato da casa perchè suo fratello ha sposato la ragazza di cui Kazuya è sempre stato innamorato.","date":"1991","episodes_count":6,"episodes_length":26,"author":" ","created_at":"2024-12-30 21:20:36","status":"Terminato","imageurl_cover":"","type":"OVA","slug":"here-is-greenwood","title_eng":"Here is Greenwood","day":"Indeterminato","favorites":8,"score":"7.33","visite":6598,"studio":"Studio Pierrot","dub":0,"always_home":0,"